flowchart TB
  Buyer[Buyer] --> UI[Next.js Procurement Console]
  UI -->|REST| API[FastAPI modular monolith]
  API --> LG[LangGraph purchasing agent]
  LG --> Tools[Typed tools]
  Tools --> ERP[Mock procurement adapters]
  LG --> Rules[Deterministic rules engine]
  Rules --> Dec[Structured Decision]
  Dec --> HITL{Needs approval?}
  HITL -->|yes| Human[Approver]
  HITL -->|no| Act[Create or modify PO]
  Human --> Act
  Act --> Val[Validation engine]
  Val -->|pass| Done[Success]
  Val -->|fail| Rec[Recovery]
  Rec --> Act
  Done --> Audit[Audit trail]
  Rec --> Audit
  API --> PG[(PostgreSQL 16 + pgvector)]
  API --> Redis[(Redis)]
  LG --> RAG[Policy RAG]
  RAG --> PG
